<title>USA: Cleveland State University, Ohio, yields 5.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Cleveland State University, Ohio, yields 5.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ohio Company said it priced $3.430 million of Cleveland State University, Ohio, general receipts bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.50 percent in 2011.</p>
